  "ingredients": [
    "1/4 cup butter",
    "2 ounce cream cheese",
    "1 cup pumpkin puree",
    "2 large egg",
    "3/4 cup almond flour",
    "1/4 cup vegan vanilla protein powder",
    "1/2 cup allulose",
    "1 teaspoon pumpkin pie spice",
    "2 teaspoon baking powder",
    "1/2 teaspoon salt",
    "6 ounce cream cheese (room temperature)",
    "1/3 cup allulose",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1 tablespoon heavy cream (as needed)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Gather and prep all of your ingredients. Pre-heat oven to 350F.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-bars-with-cream-cheese-icing/#wprm-recipe-57624-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Keto-Pumpkin-Bars-with-Cream-Cheese-Icing-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt and mix the butter and cream cheese for the cake using a microwave or double boiler.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-bars-with-cream-cheese-icing/#wprm-recipe-57624-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Keto-Pumpkin-Bars-with-Cream-Cheese-Icing-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the pumpkin and eggs. Then, mix all the wet ingredients well using a whisk or hand mixer.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-bars-with-cream-cheese-icing/#wprm-recipe-57624-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Keto-Pumpkin-Bars-with-Cream-Cheese-Icing-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a separate bowl, combine all dry ingredients: almond flour, protein powder, allulose, baking powder, pumpkin pie spice, and salt.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-bars-with-cream-cheese-icing/#wprm-recipe-57624-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Keto-Pumpkin-Bars-with-Cream-Cheese-Icing-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slowly add the dry ingredients into the wet, beating together until just combined.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-bars-with-cream-cheese-icing/#wprm-recipe-57624-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Keto-Pumpkin-Bars-with-Cream-Cheese-Icing-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer the batter to a baking pan lined with parchment paper. Bake for 28-30 minutes or until an inserted toothpick comes out clean. Allow to cool completely.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-bars-with-cream-cheese-icing/#wprm-recipe-57624-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Keto-Pumpkin-Bars-with-Cream-Cheese-Icing-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the frosting, use a hand mixer or whisk to beat the cream cheese, allulose, and vanilla extract. If needed, you can thin the frosting by adding heavy cream, 1-2 teaspoons at a time.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-bars-with-cream-cheese-icing/#wprm-recipe-57624-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Keto-Pumpkin-Bars-with-Cream-Cheese-Icing-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour the frosting over the cake and spread if needed.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-bars-with-cream-cheese-icing/#wprm-recipe-57624-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Keto-Pumpkin-Bars-with-Cream-Cheese-Icing-8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the frosting is set, remove from the pan and discard parchment paper. Cut into squares and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-bars-with-cream-cheese-icing/#wprm-recipe-57624-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
